    {
      "id": "Ugw_WkTdW5IsTDBEQJJ4AaABAg",
      "author": "@marlinpruett8343",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lagYOENBZLPYzk7LgACbnkqEM6wrUGsQts1Hunr4hQ_2s=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "When I was in Brazil for 6 months I had some friends and wanted me to go to the movies with them to see this great American movie They called it tikanika I'm going I can't remember any movie called tikanika when I got to the movie house with them I found out it was the Titanic movie I will see the Brazilian people are great friendly very friendly and nice to be with them make you feel like home",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-18T13:27:49Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "Ugw_WkTdW5IsTDBEQJJ4AaABAg.AZPPHOnhyKGAZUE3PT9h13",
          "author": "@AmazingGlobalDiscoveries",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/T2v50f6Jyxr5W4Rgq36zJV5ZHEJoK26sCLPrt8u9s0ecJuedWFhcgw42MdyvKjOVmgzbVSm3Qw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "What a wonderful memory! 😊 “Tikanika” turning out to be Titanic must have been such a funny surprise. I’m glad your six months in Brazil were filled with warm and friendly people who made you feel at home. That kindness is something many visitors remember for years. Which part of Brazil did you stay in?",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-07-20T10:25:59Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "UgyPTM6ulOO1yY_pr4J4AaABAg",
